# Place your media assets here
#
# Supported formats:
#   Images: .jpg, .jpeg, .png, .webp
#   Video:  .mp4, .mov, .avi, .mkv, .webm
#
# Naming tips for better filename-based matching:
#   - Include mood words: dark, crimson, fire, hope, city, rain
#   - Include section words: chorus, verse, bridge, intro
#   - Examples: dark_ruins.jpg, chorus_fire_montage.mp4, kai_face_closeup.mp4
